<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Delete your Aspirants Guide account</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #fbfaff;
    --text: #1a1a2e;
    --muted: #5b5b73;
    --brand: #4f2ee8;
    --line: #e3dffa;
    --panel: #f1eefe;
    color-scheme: light dark;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #121022;
      --text: #ecebf7;
      --muted: #a9a7c4;
      --brand: #9a86ff;
      --line: #2c2850;
      --panel: #1b1736;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 20px 72px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 40px 0 10px; }
  p, li { color: var(--text); }
  .lead { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 8px; }
  ol, ul { padding-left: 1.3rem; }
  li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  a { color: var(--brand); }
  .panel {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .panel p { margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .panel p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  th, td {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  th { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  footer { margin-top: 48px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Delete your Aspirants Guide account</h1>
  <p class="lead">This page explains how to ask for your Aspirants Guide account and its data to be deleted.</p>

  <h2>How to request deletion</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Send an email to <a href="mailto:YOUR-APP-EMAIL@gmail.com?subject=Delete%20my%20Aspirants%20Guide%20account">YOUR-APP-EMAIL@gmail.com</a> with the subject <strong>Delete my Aspirants Guide account</strong>.</li>
    <li>Write from the same email address you use to sign in to the app, so we can match the request to your account.</li>
    <li>We reply to confirm the request, then delete your account and data within 30 days.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="panel">
    <p><strong>Aspirants Guide</strong> is the app name shown on Google Play.</p>
    <p>Package name: com.aspirantsguide.app</p>
  </div>

  <h2>What is deleted</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <tr><th>Data</th><th>What happens</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Account details: name, email address, profile photo link and user ID</td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Study data linked to your account: completed topics, bookmarks and quiz results</td><td>Deleted</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>What is kept</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Subscription and payment records are handled by Google Play, not by us. To manage or cancel a subscription, use the Subscriptions section of the Google Play Store.</li>
    <li>We keep no other data about you once deletion is complete.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Before you delete</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Deletion cannot be undone. Your progress and saved items will be lost.</li>
    <li>Deleting your account does not cancel an active subscription. Cancel it in Google Play first if you do not want to be charged again.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Delete some data only</h2>
  <p>If you want specific data removed without deleting your account, email the same address and say which data you want removed.</p>

  <footer>
    <p>Privacy policy: <a href="https://aspirantsguide.github.io/privacy/">aspirantsguide.github.io/privacy</a></p>
  </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
